WEBVTT

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.770
And the little girl
who arises out of their union

00:07:00.794 --> 00:07:02.901
will of course be not Korean or German

00:07:02.925 --> 00:07:05.444
or French or Thai or Scotch or Canadian

00:07:05.468 --> 00:07:07.549
or even American, but a wonderful

00:07:07.573 --> 00:07:11.683
and constantly evolving
mix of all those places.

00:07:11.707 --> 00:07:14.448
And potentially, everything about the way

00:07:14.472 --> 00:07:17.197
that young woman dreams about the world,

00:07:17.221 --> 00:07:20.243
writes about the world,
thinks about the world,

00:07:20.267 --> 00:07:22.213
could be something different,

00:07:22.237 --> 00:07:25.408
because it comes out of this
almost unprecedented

00:07:25.432 --> 00:07:27.381
blend of cultures.

00:07:27.405 --> 00:07:30.465
Where you come from now
is much less important